{"operations":[{"content":"The club charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution. The exact amount a member pays each year is fixed in the annex of the charter. [[cite:obs-0383f38bfcbcdc297cd8f5830eafc46c23817cec \"Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.\"]]\n\nAccording to the annex, the ordinary contributions amount to one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January. [[cite:obs-78ddd51ea6e98cbeecd5e9deb69594071047bff4 \"Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January.\"]]","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added statements about the membership fee and the yearly amount paid by members, each supported by exact quotes from the charter and annex sources as required."}